summary:
  The engine no longer takes the listener off a list that has stopped growing.

history:
  A list stops growing when its writer has ended or the station is gone.
  Left on it, the player reaches the end of what the list names and then no
  stop() returns to the widget: measured, the event loop stood until the list
  grew, which it never does. The engine leaves seven seconds before the end.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
          if (SlideLogic.mustLeave((listLast + 1) * SlideLogic.SEG_MS, placeMs)) {

replace:
          if (false && SlideLogic.mustLeave((listLast + 1) * SlideLogic.SEG_MS, placeMs)) {

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_slideengine.qml::test_a_list_that_stops_growing_is_left_before_it_runs_out.
